            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jenny Roberson"
            },
            "reviewBody": "These are delicious! I didn't have almonds so used some pecans and cashews about 1/2 cup.. My husband is in heaven. I'm doubling this next time for a 9X13 baking dish. Thanks for posting!",
            "datePublished": "2018-08-02T00:44:12.530Z"
          },
          {
